Sval: keep Screenshots' keyboard focus in its buttons and overlay

Left or Right on the Save visible / Save full page buttons moved the
crosshair and took focus off the buttons, so no key moved between them.
From there Tab found nothing: the overlay prevents every key's default,
and its focus lock only knew the face and Cancel. Left and Right move
between the buttons, and Tab with nothing in the overlay focused enters
it as the buttons' Tab does.

